WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.450
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.900
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.110
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.110 --> 00:00:59.370
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.500
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.630
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.630
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.680
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.890
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:27.270
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:29.860
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.650
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:47.620
<b>Heaven and Earth</b>

31
00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.620
How dare that punk do that?!

32
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.630
Before Lucy comes to,
this country will be shred to pieces!

33
00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.380
We gotta do something about it ourselves!

34
00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.120
Take down Doflamingo, and the bird cage goes away!

35
00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.460
You really are dense.

36
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.480
My message to you should be clear:
"Give me Straw Hat."

37
00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:26.000
Gatz-san, Lucy still needs more time to recover!
But I believe many people will die before that happens!

38
00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.040
I know! But I can't send
an incapacitated fighter into the ring!

39
00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.960
Whatever happens,
I won't give him up before he's recovered!

40
00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.430
Who's there?

41
00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.020
T... T-T-Trafalgar Law!

42
00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.520
The W-W-Warlo...

43
00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:55.450
You guys... don't you think you're running too much?

44
00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.740
Oh, that's because... Um...

45
00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.240
Will he regain his Haki?

46
00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.530
O-Oh, the thing is...

47
00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.530
He told me that he needed ten minutes,

48
00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.290
and now we've got three minutes and twenty seconds to go!

49
00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.330
No time to lose, then.

50
00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.830
I'll take care of him from here.

51
00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:14.540
Okay!

52
00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:23.930
Less than three minutes remain
until the bird cage closes completely.

53
00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.430
<b>Sevio</b>

54
00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.520
Barrier!

55
00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.610
Now, let's do this, guys!

56
00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:35.360
My barrier will never break!

57
00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.400
Push!

58
00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.990
Follow Zoro-senpai!

59
00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.630
King!

60
00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.880
All together now, and push!

61
00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.610
How strange.

62
00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:09.100
How can they exert that much power
with those injured bodies?

63
00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:17.400
Just a few minutes ago, they were burned out
and couldn't even stand up.

64
00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.650
What was all that fluff?

65
00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.950
They were Dandehealions.

66
00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:25.950
"Dandehealions"?

67
00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.740
That's right!

68
00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:33.040
They're dandelions made from Princess Mansherry's tears.

69
00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:47.900
Wait for me, wait for me!

70
00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.100
Hurry up, or you'll get torn to shreds!

71
00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.910
Run faster!

72
00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:55.890
I can't, dammit!
I can't believe I twisted my ankle at a time like this!

73
00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.690
Hang in there!

74
00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.000
Huh?! I can run!

75
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.240
He's way too fast! What's going on?!

76
00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:14.750
Dandehealion petals can miraculously heal people over a wide area.

77
00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.340
Princess Mansherry is worried about
what's happening to Dressrosa,

78
00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.590
and so she's shedding tears.

79
00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.630
I truly believe it will save many lives!

80
00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:32.930
So that's why those previously immobile fighters are...

81
00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.390
However, the drawback of this ability is...

82
00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:39.940
that it's only a temporary recovery, lasting for just a few minutes!

83
00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.490
It's unfortunate, but they'll revert to their
former state when time's up!

84
00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:48.820
So this is a last-ditch life support measure for our survival!

85
00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.530
The pain just suddenly left!

86
00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.450
I can run! I can escape!

87
00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.550
It's a miracle, doctor!

88
00:05:57.550 --> 00:06:00.380
The gods themselves must have descended to save our country!

89
00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:02.710
Kabu-san...

90
00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.220
Yes, Princess Mansherry?

91
00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:07.400
This is how I fight!

92
00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.930
I don't know how to use weapons,

93
00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.930
and I can't bring down bad people, but...

94
00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.440
the tears won't stop!

95
00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.440
Yes, it's very you!
An honorable way to fight!

96
00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:31.160
How in the...
The injured are recovering, one after another!

97
00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.500
Let's just get outta here!

98
00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.200
Hey, wait a minute!

99
00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.250
Heed my voice!

100
00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:40.750
What is it, Hundredth-Degree Hack?!

101
00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.750
No, the guy behind him!

102
00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:49.380
It's the five-star, God Usopp!

103
00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.140
Just what kind of crime did he commit?!

104
00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.850
Alright, listen up, men!

105
00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.850
The strong among you need to go to the east and west sides of town!

106
00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.350
My friends are pushing back the bird cage in those places!

107
00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.020
Give 'em a hand!

108
00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.020
Help them push back the bird cage?

109
00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.900
I don't think there's even a way to stop that thing!

110
00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.070
Yeah, there's no way!

111
00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:11.740
Quit making excuses! Believe in my friends!

112
00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.240
It's the wrath of God!

113
00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.830
We're on it!

114
00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:16.570
Run!

115
00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:17.870
Hurry up!

116
00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.870
Everybody, don't abandon hope!

117
00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.500
There are people who haven't yet given up!

118
00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.830
Come on, hurry up!

119
00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.210
Thank you, Rebecca!

120
00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.050
They're all trying so hard to stop the bird cage...

121
00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:47.820
But if this bird cage really is unstoppable,
all of their efforts will be wasted!

122
00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:10.210
I know I'm no match for him, but...

123
00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:13.540
But everybody's fighting at their hardest!

124
00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.550
I've got to do something, too!

125
00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.540
Father... If push comes to shove, I'll...

126
00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.880
kill Doflamingo!

127
00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:30.940
Viola-san!

128
00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.070
Rebecca! Why are you here?!

129
00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.740
Viola-san, I...

130
00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.410
Don't do anything foolish!

131
00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:44.670
If I allow you to die, I won't be able to face Kyros, nor my late sister!

132
00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.750
So, what did you come to see me for, Viola?

133
00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:56.010
The Donquixote Family is about to be obliterated.

134
00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:01.600
If I do nothing to take responsibility as a
former commander, it would be too selfish of me.

135
00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.640
You can't!

136
00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.700
Either I die, or you die!

137
00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:20.950
Doffy!

138
00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.960
You're ever the passionate one, Violet.

139
00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:32.050
<b>Town Center</b>

140
00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.540
Hey, we've come all this way! Just let us through!

141
00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:33.050
The bird cage is right there!

142
00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.630
They say there's danger ahead,
and we can barely advance here as well!

143
00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:41.350
People all over the country arrived here
at the same time, so we can't even move!

144
00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:44.350
<b>Smile Factory</b>

145
00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:52.070
You gotta push more! Push harder!

146
00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:57.690
The bird cage will definitely stop! Just keep pushing!

147
00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.620
We got it!

148
00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:05.160
<b>Vicinity of the Smile Factory








At the Bird Cage</b>

149
00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:10.330
How are we faring?

150
00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.840
It's slowing down... I think!

151
00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:18.430
Now that you mention it,
it does appear to be slowing down!

152
00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:30.170
Why are you here?!

153
00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:35.310
Oh my... I can't tell who's there, as I'm blind.

154
00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.120
Crap!

155
00:10:56.460 --> 00:11:01.480
It's hard to leave behind such a band of fools, is it not?

156
00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:06.640
Please allow me to assist in even the slightest capacity, despite my limited ability!

157
00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.810
Company, halt!

158
00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:15.190
Support those "unknown" people pushing the cage!

159
00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:16.410
Aye aye, sir!

160
00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:17.280
The Navy?!

161
00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.490
Oh, quite the aid!

162
00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.280
This is encouraging!

163
00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.290
Those of you unable to use Haki, head for the factory!

164
00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.040
Aye aye, sir!

165
00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:35.340
The Navy?!

166
00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.880
Push the bird cage back!

167
00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.470
R-Run for it!

168
00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.390
Hey, what're you doing?!

169
00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.180
Nothing'll change if we just keep running!

170
00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:52.810
I'm gonna push, too!

171
00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.450
H-Hey!

172
00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:56.150
Push!

173
00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:59.900
Oh, dammit, I'll push, too!

174
00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.900
I'm no weakling!

175
00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.910
Yeah, that's the spirit!

176
00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.320
Me neither!

177
00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.830
We're gonna push, too!

178
00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.330
We wanna defend our own country!

179
00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.160
Push it, all together now!

180
00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:15.290
Alright, you guys!
Give it everything you've got!

181
00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.890
Yeah!

182
00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:20.880
<b>Sevio</b>

183
00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:21.920
There they are!

184
00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:27.260
Warriors, let us push too!

185
00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.770
Get pushing already!

186
00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.700
Yeah!

187
00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.020
Us, too!

188
00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.980
We can't just let it cut us without doing anything!

189
00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.480
Thank you all! I'm counting on you!

190
00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.280
Yeah, let's work together!

191
00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.000
Here we go, guys!

192
00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.070
Yeah!

193
00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.470
Let's go!

194
00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.000
Yeah!

195
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.620
Push!

196
00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.700
It's moving again!

197
00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.540
But it did stop for a moment.

198
00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:41.090
So it's stoppable!
Zoro-senpai is as awesome as ever!

199
00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:45.090
Keep pushing! Let's stall the shutting of the bird cage!

200
00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.000
Stay focused!

201
00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.760
Hold on! Put more into it!

202
00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.680
What... Your Majesty? Army Commander Tank?

203
00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:56.390
Well done!

204
00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:02.940
If it weren't for you all,
we would've lost thousands already!

205
00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.280
Screw this bird cage!

206
00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:11.070
People are meant to be free! Keep pushing!

207
00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.740
Yes, sir!

208
00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.290
More!

209
00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.000
Yes, sir!

210
00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:20.000
Push the bird cage back!

211
00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.670
That's enough, Viola-san!

212
00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:37.810
Viola-san!

213
00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.690
A decade...

214
00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:51.700
Did you really think I would hesitate just because
we spent all that time together as a Family, Violet?

215
00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.740
That I would hesitate to kill you?

216
00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:05.750
I don't criticize my associates
for their mistakes.

217
00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.430
However, I don't condone betrayal.

218
00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.610
And now, next up is...

219
00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.790
Look at her, Violet!

220
00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:42.750
Rebecca!

221
00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:48.340
Viola-san... I can't control my body...

222
00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:53.270
Poor girl. She's so scared.

223
00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:54.100
You can't!

224
00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:15.410
Now, right this way!

225
00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:19.510
Stop it! Don't involve Rebecca!

226
00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:22.540
What am I... doing?!

227
00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.660
Viola-san!

228
00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.170
Rebecca!

229
00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.210
No! I don't wanna do this!

230
00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.840
Now, kill her.

231
00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.770
Viola-san!

232
00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.770
Why am I doing this?!

233
00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.280
Rebecca!

234
00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.960
I don't wanna do this!

235
00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.000
Viola-san!

236
00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.670
It's starting to slice up the old Royal Grounds!

237
00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.670
Damn! It stopped once!

238
00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.840
If it keeps closing in,
people will start dying one after another!

239
00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.840
Don't give up! Keep pushing!

240
00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.430
Stall it even for a second!

241
00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.600
How long till Lucy's back up?

242
00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.100
Uh, let me see...

243
00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:33.350
Time until the slowed bird cage closes completely:

244
00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:38.510
sixty seconds.

245
00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:41.990
Time remaining until Lucy's comeback:

246
00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:44.300
sixty seconds.

247
00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.670
It stopped once!

248
00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.170
We can keep on holding it back!

249
00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.720
Stop the cage!

250
00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:14.480
Stand strong and hang in there!

251
00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.320
Shut up! You're distracting us!

252
00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:22.510
Let's make this the greatest thing we've ever done!

253
00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:39.550
Please... Please be safe...

254
00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:42.050
As many lives as possible...

255
00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:50.100
Alright, everyone!

256
00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.220
It won't be much longer!

257
00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:57.280
Wh-Who's talking?

258
00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.620
Who is that? Now isn't the time!

259
00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.720
Where is he shouting from?

260
00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.540
Our star shall return!

261
00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:12.130
Oh, hey!

262
00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.630
There he is!

263
00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.930
You're the announcer from the Colosseum, Gatz!

264
00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.180
When did you get up there?

265
00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.350
And what are you up to?

266
00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.770
Everyone, have you forgotten?

267
00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:29.890
Now isn't the time to fool around!

268
00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.400
Our country is on the verge of destruction!

269
00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.320
You aren't the king!

270
00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:42.030
No, of course you haven't forgotten!

271
00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:49.290
That funny, bold star who burst onto the scene...

272
00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:55.290
in the tournament at the Corrida Colosseum today!

273
00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:57.510
Star?!

274
00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.670
Don't tell me he's talking about...

275
00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.820
...me!

276
00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:12.730
Well, I told you I'd stay here with you, but would you mind if I departed?

277
00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:13.850
Trafal...

278
00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.860
Gah! Law! He's gone!

279
00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.860
What... where did he go?!

280
00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.070
I have not forgotten.

281
00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.910
He tamed the killer bull feared by all,

282
00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:33.000
and toppled the towering Giant!

283
00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:38.210
He even knocked out the living legend, Don Chinjao!

284
00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:46.470
The little gladiator who made the Colosseum...
nay, the whole of Dressrosa burst with excitement!

285
00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:50.720
Never before have I seen anyone fight so freely,

286
00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:57.060
and make a competition as thrilling as he did!

287
00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:03.020
I was there watching it!
He's talking about that guy, isn't he?

288
00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.570
I saw him at the Colosseum!

289
00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:07.030
I watched it on a screen in town!

290
00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.530
And his name is...

291
00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:13.500
Lucy!

292
00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:17.500
So what? He's just some gladiator!

293
00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.750
Lucy...

294
00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:25.130
Help me, Lucy...

295
00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.640
That's right! It's Lucy!

296
00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:31.760
But that was just an alias!

297
00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.270
His real name is...

298
00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:43.530
The pirate, Straw Hat...

299
00:21:44.470 --> 00:21:46.570
Luffy!

300
00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:51.030
Wha... that's who Lucy was under his mask?

301
00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.080
Since we've been fooled by
and been under the control of a pirate,

302
00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.280
it's probably difficult for us to trust another pirate!

303
00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:01.080
However...

304
00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.920
He's different from the Donquixote Family, who appeared disguised as heroes,

305
00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:08.420
on that night a decade ago!

306
00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:12.720
Straw Hat Luffy is the man that our true king,

307
00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:17.220
King Riku, called our "hope"!

308
00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:26.940
Right now, he's knocked out after being wounded in battle, but...

309
00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:29.940
It's not over yet!

310
00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:35.080
Tremble with joy, Dressrosa!

311
00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:38.620
Lucy...

312
00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:42.630
swore this to me!

313
00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:49.170
Doflamingo will...

314
00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.940
...be KOed in a single blow!

315
00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:12.070
He's got a hell of a big mouth!

316
00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:17.160
You've gotta do it...
We can't hold out much longer, Luffy!

317
00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:21.250
Amazing!

318
00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:21.750
Lucy!

319
00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.130
Are you listening,

320
00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.000
Doflamingo?!

321
00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.380
You...

322
00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:36.200
used our king as a puppet, deceived the world,

323
00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:40.470
and lived here in Dressrosa as a false king!

324
00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:43.690
This will be your...

325
00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:45.940
execution stand!

326
00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:52.570
Gatz...

327
00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:57.490
I see everything you're up to, Doflamingo!

328
00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:00.040
If you want me, come and get me!

329
00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:04.830
Stay away from Viola-sama and Rebecca-sama!

330
00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:10.590
It won't be long before the star forged in the Colosseum,

331
00:24:10.590 --> 00:24:13.600
Lucy, comes back!

332
00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:19.100
Until that moment comes, hang in there!

333
00:24:28.060 --> 00:24:31.860
Luffy-senpai! Here we go!

334
00:24:44.080 --> 00:24:44.980
Hajrudin!

335
00:24:48.540 --> 00:24:49.600
What the...

336
00:24:49.600 --> 00:24:53.600
The injured who recovered earlier are collapsing again!

337
00:24:53.600 --> 00:24:55.380
Time's up.

338
00:24:56.380 --> 00:25:00.880
The effects of the Dandehealions on the initial recipients are wearing off.

339
00:25:01.280 --> 00:25:03.270
And it won't work twice in a row!

340
00:25:05.140 --> 00:25:11.280
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!
All because I don't have the strength...

341
00:25:11.280 --> 00:25:13.000
I lifted them up for a moment,

342
00:25:13.000 --> 00:25:15.700
only to drop them right back down! I'm awful!

343
00:25:15.700 --> 00:25:18.160
No, Princess Mansherry.

344
00:25:18.160 --> 00:25:24.200
If it weren't for the Dandehealions, who knows how many people would have died from the bird cage!

345
00:25:24.200 --> 00:25:25.330
But...

346
00:25:25.330 --> 00:25:26.330
Look!

347
00:25:27.330 --> 00:25:30.630
You've created a miracle!

348
00:25:31.000 --> 00:25:33.710
Oh, please! What weaklings!

349
00:25:33.900 --> 00:25:39.600
People in the back take the places of the fallen! And bring more people!

350
00:25:39.600 --> 00:25:41.060
Yeah!

351
00:25:41.060 --> 00:25:47.000
We'll hold out no matter what,
until Lucy frees us from the bird cage!

352
00:25:47.000 --> 00:25:49.770
Yeah!

353
00:25:49.770 --> 00:25:51.870
They've held out long enough.

354
00:25:51.870 --> 00:25:55.270
Luffyland will take over from there and rid us of the bird cage!

355
00:25:57.470 --> 00:26:03.160
And now the moment you've been waiting for...
Lucy will come back in ten seconds!

356
00:26:05.700 --> 00:26:11.040
He should be somewhere, listening! Call out our star's name!

357
00:26:11.530 --> 00:26:14.550
Lucy! Lucy!

358
00:26:14.550 --> 00:26:31.900
Lucy! Lucy! Lucy!

359
00:26:21.690 --> 00:26:24.390
Three seconds to go!

360
00:26:31.000 --> 00:26:32.400
Two!

361
00:26:39.160 --> 00:26:40.200
Gatz-san!

362
00:26:40.200 --> 00:26:42.950
Lucy! Lucy!

363
00:26:42.950 --> 00:26:44.910
One!

364
00:26:44.910 --> 00:26:46.290
Ludicrous.

365
00:26:46.970 --> 00:26:49.800
Go to hell, Doflamingo!

366
00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:53.040
Our star Lucy's gonna...

367
00:26:53.040 --> 00:26:54.920
drop you with a single blow!

368
00:27:01.560 --> 00:27:04.970
Zero!

369
00:27:17.090 --> 00:27:20.950
Viola, it's your turn to be silenced.

370
00:27:22.990 --> 00:27:24.660
Forever.

371
00:27:25.840 --> 00:27:28.410
No!

372
00:27:35.750 --> 00:27:37.180
Viola-san!

373
00:27:37.180 --> 00:27:40.300
Close your eyes, Rebecca!

374
00:27:40.300 --> 00:27:43.140
You don't have to see a thing!
This is just a bad dream!

375
00:27:44.300 --> 00:27:47.140
No matter what happens, forget everything!

376
00:27:47.900 --> 00:27:52.270
I won't hold a grudge against you so...

377
00:27:52.270 --> 00:27:53.480
just forget about it, okay?

378
00:27:57.700 --> 00:28:00.080
No!

379
00:28:00.080 --> 00:28:03.930
It's not your fault at all!

380
00:28:03.930 --> 00:28:05.900
I'm so sorry, Rebecca!

381
00:28:07.000 --> 00:28:11.710
This will leave a deep scar in your heart!

382
00:28:14.540 --> 00:28:20.590
No!

383
00:28:50.030 --> 00:28:50.660
Go!

384
00:28:54.330 --> 00:28:58.670
He has come!

385
00:28:58.670 --> 00:29:01.800
Lucy!

386
00:29:08.500 --> 00:29:11.310
Lucy! Lucy!

387
00:29:15.220 --> 00:29:16.600
Straw Hat...

388
00:29:29.890 --> 00:29:32.490
A flashy comeback, I suppose.

389
00:29:32.490 --> 00:29:37.580
But you've barely managed to regain your Haki.

390
00:29:39.100 --> 00:29:42.380
You must barely be able to stand, no?

391
00:29:46.530 --> 00:29:47.930
That...

392
00:29:49.720 --> 00:29:51.220
goes for you too, right?!

393
00:29:58.120 --> 00:29:59.520
Lucy!

394
00:30:05.210 --> 00:30:05.950
Chambres!

395
00:30:11.270 --> 00:30:12.370
Rebecca!

396
00:30:23.060 --> 00:30:24.560
There you are.

397
00:30:26.530 --> 00:30:29.470
Well, watch closely, then...

398
00:30:30.360 --> 00:30:33.850
as your hope is crushed.

399
00:30:42.220 --> 00:30:43.700
Everwhite!

400
00:30:48.320 --> 00:30:52.320
Th-The entire town's turned to strings!

401
00:30:55.910 --> 00:30:57.410
Lucy!

402
00:30:58.610 --> 00:30:59.370
Why, you...

403
00:31:02.230 --> 00:31:03.330
Futile.

404
00:31:07.670 --> 00:31:09.090
Thousand Arrows!

405
00:31:10.420 --> 00:31:11.180
Flapping...

406
00:31:15.780 --> 00:31:17.270
Thread!

407
00:31:18.780 --> 00:31:19.680
Armament!

408
00:31:37.800 --> 00:31:41.080
What's the matter?
I thought you were back at full strength?

409
00:31:46.680 --> 00:31:50.800
Have you really regained your Haki, Lucy?

410
00:31:54.100 --> 00:31:56.100
I-Is he gonna be okay?

411
00:32:24.670 --> 00:32:25.830
Lucy!

412
00:32:26.920 --> 00:32:28.300
That was pretty loud!

413
00:32:28.600 --> 00:32:30.050
It's too dusty to see clearly.

414
00:32:30.430 --> 00:32:32.630
Did Lucy win?

415
00:32:33.750 --> 00:32:36.550
The bird cage is still here!

416
00:32:36.550 --> 00:32:38.640
Hurry up, Lucy!

417
00:32:44.340 --> 00:32:45.440
Wh-What the...

418
00:32:47.160 --> 00:32:49.270
My body's moving on its own...

419
00:32:54.450 --> 00:32:59.450
I can't believe you're still alive!
Shall I impale you?

420
00:33:03.100 --> 00:33:05.710
Is that why you came running back?

421
00:33:06.250 --> 00:33:09.090
You made it out alive again, Luffy.

422
00:33:09.090 --> 00:33:11.630
Hmph! Next time I'll win!

423
00:33:13.030 --> 00:33:15.300
What happened to that Kong Gun you're so proud of?

424
00:33:15.300 --> 00:33:17.130
Well, it's like this, Rayleigh!

425
00:33:17.130 --> 00:33:20.300
This guy was way, way bigger than the other one...

426
00:33:20.300 --> 00:33:21.630
So it didn't work!

427
00:33:23.900 --> 00:33:25.730
That's quite the problem.

428
00:33:28.660 --> 00:33:33.900
But if the Kong Gun isn't working,
you have to come up with something else.

429
00:33:35.290 --> 00:33:36.500
Something else?

430
00:33:39.870 --> 00:33:41.580
Amusing, isn't it?

431
00:33:42.290 --> 00:33:44.400
Every single one of you...

432
00:33:44.400 --> 00:33:50.040
would have been better off staying in my cage and submitting to my manipulation.

433
00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:52.920
Cage?

434
00:33:54.190 --> 00:33:55.590
Manipulation?

435
00:33:56.180 --> 00:33:59.550
Humans are mere scum.

436
00:34:00.490 --> 00:34:03.680
Enough, already!

437
00:34:10.930 --> 00:34:14.030
The Royal Plateau is getting cut!

438
00:34:16.800 --> 00:34:17.910
Hurry up, Luffy!

439
00:34:29.240 --> 00:34:30.380
Gonna do it again?

440
00:34:33.420 --> 00:34:38.510
If you turn into that Bound-Man of yours, I won't just have you kill your friends...

441
00:34:38.510 --> 00:34:42.720
but everyone in the country!

442
00:34:58.490 --> 00:35:00.300
Gear Fourth!

443
00:35:05.450 --> 00:35:06.330
The strings-!

444
00:35:14.300 --> 00:35:19.500
You've barely got any stamina left. How many seconds can you stay in that form?

445
00:35:24.400 --> 00:35:25.140
Lucy!

446
00:35:29.020 --> 00:35:32.020
He chose to fight me midair?

447
00:35:32.020 --> 00:35:33.400
He's got guts!

448
00:35:36.440 --> 00:35:40.490
Will I get to see how you're gonna "one-hit KO" me?!

449
00:35:58.830 --> 00:36:02.340
It's annoying to have you stand over me!

450
00:36:02.630 --> 00:36:07.400
You're always trying to chain down anything and everything...

451
00:36:12.910 --> 00:36:16.770
...and controlling and manipulating everybody!

452
00:36:26.710 --> 00:36:31.120
I feel like I'm suffocating!

453
00:36:31.120 --> 00:36:32.660
Blame your own birthright!

454
00:36:32.660 --> 00:36:37.160
All of you were born trash, fit only for manipulation!

455
00:36:37.760 --> 00:36:40.880
You humans are different from me!

456
00:36:41.900 --> 00:36:43.880
Shut up!

457
00:36:43.880 --> 00:36:47.600
I'm gonna kick your ass and get outta here!

458
00:36:48.140 --> 00:36:51.230
Do your worst, brat!

459
00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:53.350
Spiderweb!

460
00:36:57.900 --> 00:37:02.400
But if the Kong Gun isn't working,
you have to come up with something else.

461
00:37:03.700 --> 00:37:05.400
Rubber...

462
00:37:10.000 --> 00:37:11.290
Something else?

463
00:37:11.590 --> 00:37:16.290
That's right.
Gear Fourth taxes your body far too much.

464
00:37:16.290 --> 00:37:19.000
You've got to think of something else.

465
00:37:20.850 --> 00:37:22.710
How about this, then?

466
00:37:26.540 --> 00:37:30.310
What?
That'll just make the problem even worse!

467
00:37:40.500 --> 00:37:42.320
King Kong...

468
00:37:50.450 --> 00:37:53.600
If you won't obey, I'll just kill you!

469
00:37:53.600 --> 00:37:56.540
Sixteen Holy Bullets!

470
00:38:03.040 --> 00:38:04.670
God Thread!

471
00:38:09.070 --> 00:38:10.850
...Gun!

472
00:38:36.800 --> 00:38:41.290
And in a certain land, there are people who call the Family of "D"...

473
00:38:42.600 --> 00:38:44.550
"the sworn enemy of the gods"!
